<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1095_3485.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reinhardt</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gottes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnadenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pfaltz</unclear>-
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grave</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bey</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-92" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhein</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hertzog</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-132" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bäyernn</unclear></placeName>.
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnsernn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grues</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuevornn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbare</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> Weise, liebe
<lb n="4"/>beßondere, Wir möegen euch gnediger meinung nicht
<lb n="5"/>verhalten, was gestalt wir nun mer in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">achte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jar</unclear>,
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müntzmeister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehabt</unclear>, welcher sich <persName resp="#ner">Jacob Merckh</persName>,
<lb n="7"/>vonn <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanct Gallenn</placeName> geschribenn unnd allso euer an-
<lb n="8"/>gehöeriger und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitburger</unclear> sein soll. Dieweil er dan
<lb n="9"/>nach willen deß Allmechtigen, verschiennenen frei-
<lb n="10"/>tags <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> zehenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißes</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seliglichen</unclear> ver-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">storben</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ueber</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienst</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einiche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechnung</unclear> seines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntzwercks</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geleistet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sondern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darnaehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewiß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wo</unclear> solche rechnungen zue handt genomen, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thonen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">goldts</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> also ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merckliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">große</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soma</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueverrechnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdet</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wan</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> aber gemelter müntzmeister seliger, in
<lb n="18"/>seinem von sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegebenem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">revers</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> glaub-
<lb n="19"/>wuerdige abschrifft ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiebey</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueempfahen</unclear>) alle
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haab</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guettere</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">denn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fhall</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ei</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">manngel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechnungen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befinden</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="22"/>unnß sonsten des restandts nicht erholen köndten,
<lb n="23"/>der gehoer verschrieben und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verpfendet</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleich</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wißen</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mergedachte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rech</unclear>-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1095_3486.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">=nungen</unclear> befunden werden möchten. Sintemall wir die=
<lb n="26"/>=selbigen. annderer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> obligender geschefftenn
<lb n="27"/>halber. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bißdahero</unclear> nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürnemmen</unclear>, noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anhören</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khönnen</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/>auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverörtterung</unclear> derselben. noch ein guette zeitt
<lb n="29"/>darzu gehören würdtet. Nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">destoweniger</unclear>.
<lb n="30"/>haben wir nicht underlassen sollen. Euch mergedachts
<lb n="31"/>unnsers Müntzmeisters seligen gelegenheitt. zuver=
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">=stendigen</unclear>. Demnach und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieruff</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> gantz gnedig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinnen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wöllet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbstendic</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichten</unclear>. wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehemals</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Krentzl</unclear></persName>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seligen</unclear> sachen. bey euch gewant unnd geschaffen.
<lb n="36"/>was er vonn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seinem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vätterlichem</unclear> erbtheil. oder
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annderen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugewachsen</unclear>. und anerstorbenen erbschaften,
<lb n="38"/>er erbet. und bekommen, er auch sonnsten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> allen
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liegendt</unclear>: und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fharenden</unclear> guettern. so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zustendig</unclear>.
<lb n="40"/>bey euch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerfordern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehabt</unclear>, dasselbig alles
<lb n="41"/>der gebuer. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ordenlich</unclear>. unnd vleissig inventirern
<lb n="42"/>lassen. Auch die fursehung. unnd anordnung thun. das
<lb n="43"/>von allem dem jenigen. biß uf unnser gnedige zue=
<lb n="44"/>=lassung. nichts verendert. noch enteussert. sonder
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> deß inventarij. warhafftige abschrifft überschickt.
<lb n="46"/>Wie wir dan gleichergestalt, alle seine verlassen=
<lb n="47"/>=schafft. alhie auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschreiben</unclear> und inventirern lassen.
<lb n="48"/>An disem allem. verhandlet Ir die billicheit. Und
<lb n="49"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seindt</unclear> ein solches mit gnedigem willen zubeschul=
<lb n="50"/>=den. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerkennen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urpiettig</unclear> und geneigt. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear>.
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">immern</unclear> <origDate when="1578-01-15" cert="medium" resp="#ner">am 15. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Januarij</unclear>. Anno etc. 78.</origDate>
<lb n="52"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Reichard Pfaltzgrave</persName> etc.
